            <ArticleTitle>Community Care of North Carolina's approach to asthma management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>393-400</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Community Care of North Carolina (CCNC) takes a comprehensive approach to asthma management. Support from CCNC helps providers follow evidence-based practice guidelines; data guide continuous quality improvement initiatives and inform the care of individual patients and populations; and care managers work with high-risk patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
